### Create a semester
POST http://localhost:3001/api/semesters
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "name": "Semester 1, 2026" }

### List semesters (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/semesters
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Create a unit
POST http://localhost:3001/api/units
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "code": "cosc 325", "name": "Data Structures" }

### List units
GET http://localhost:3001/api/units
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Update progress
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/units/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "progress": 40 }

### Delete a unit (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/units/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

