### Create an assignment (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/assignments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "title": "Binary tree lab", "type": "Assignment", "unitId": 1, "dueDate": "2026-11-25" }

### List (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Mark complete (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/assignments/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "completed": true }

